  "prefLabel": "Plc 1004.10 Jurisprudence Examination Fees for Land Surveyors",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1004.10 Jurisprudence Examination Fees for Land Surveyors. The fee for the jurisprudence examination for land surveyors as regulated by the board of licensure for land surveyors under RSA 310-A:53-74 shall be $40.\n\nSource. #14244, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14377, eff 10-8-25, EXPIRES: 10-8-35 (formerly Plc 1004.09)",
